  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds IMPORT_MEDICAL_HISTORY (=30) to PermissionEnum, under the MEDICAL_HISTORY module. Guards the paper-history import flow: approving an import writes machine-transcribed data into the patient record (antecedents, back-dated encounters, notes, treatments), so it needs its own permission instead of riding on MEDICAL_HISTORY. Non-breaking, additive.",
